    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Someone is capturing all the birds around the world. It's time for you to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685550/extras/6e748341bd335cabdd01ac85bf9a2166.avif?t=1750941180\" width=224 height=75 /></span>Snaketris is a puzzle mechanics mashup where your main goal is to liberate all the trapped birds. Navigate through deserts, forests, snow or beaches in over 25 beautifully designed levels, unlocking cages, collecting keys, using bombs and items in your way to become the ultimate animal hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit our website now to play a demo!\u00a0\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685550/extras/41bae21c09e95ec0252a84517085a182.avif?t=1750941180\" width=227 height=75 /></span>- A puzzle game with platform elements - The best from both worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 25 beautifully manually-crafted levels in 4 different environments (Desert, Forest, Beach and Snow) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Innovative mechanics on every level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple and intuitive controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Logic solving challenges at every level</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Someone is capturing all the birds around the world. It's time for you to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685550/extras/6e748341bd335cabdd01ac85bf9a2166.avif?t=1750941180\" width=224 height=75 /></span>Snaketris is a puzzle mechanics mashup where your main goal is to liberate all the trapped birds. Navigate through deserts, forests, snow or beaches in over 25 beautifully designed levels, unlocking cages, collecting keys, using bombs and items in your way to become the ultimate animal hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit our website now to play a demo!\u00a0\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685550/extras/41bae21c09e95ec0252a84517085a182.avif?t=1750941180\" width=227 height=75 /></span>- A puzzle game with platform elements - The best from both worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 25 beautifully manually-crafted levels in 4 different environments (Desert, Forest, Beach and Snow) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Innovative mechanics on every level </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple and intuitive controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Logic solving challenges at every level</p>",
